   a. Your Revenue is less than US$100,000.
   b. You are an individual using it for personal, learning or research purposes.
   c. You are a non-profit, school or university.
   d. You are evaluating the Software, for up to 30 days.

3. Commercial license
   If none of section 2 applies to you, you need a paid commercial license from the
